{"id":"vod_bf_22937","vodId":"22937","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"迷糊餐厅第一季","name_cn":"迷糊餐厅第一季","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-24/ba7958aea07aa321b3ac9e286ecb5b77.jpg"},"summary":"小鸟游是家中独子，上有姐姐下有妹妹，从小生活在女人堆里，酷爱一切和可爱有关的事物。机缘巧合的来到一家叫做瓦古娜利亚的餐厅打工，开始了学校、打工、家事三点一线的忙碌生活。小鸟游渐渐发现，原来瓦古娜利亚餐厅的店员都各具特色：种岛是个外形娇小，长着一张娃娃脸的可爱女生，凭借这令自己相当头疼的卡哇伊外形深得大家疼爱。伊波有着男性恐惧症，对女顾客服务完美的无法挑剔，却因为这奇怪的病症经常殴打男顾客。八千代是外场负责人，特点是喜欢佩戴一把武士道，和爱吃的店长白藤杏子，冷面厨师佐藤三人有着暧昧不清的关系。面对这些怪异却有趣的同事，小鸟游也随着时间渐渐融入到了这别具特色的餐厅打工生活中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 08:18:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mihucantingdiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mihucantingdiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/mihucantingdiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/mihucantingdiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mihucantingdiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mihucantingdiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mihucantingdiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/mihucantingdiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mihucantingdiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mihucantingdiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/mihucantingdiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mihucantingdiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/mihucantingdiyiji/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:19